    "name": "plst backend — debugging",
    "description": "Every route of the plst backend (back/src/server.ts + back/src/library/routes.ts).\n\nSet the collection variable `PLST_back_domain` to the backend origin (default http://127.0.0.1:8000).\nSet `user_id` to the acting user — most /api/library/* routes require the `x-user-id` header (there is no login; an invalid id is a 400, an unknown id a 404).\n\nStatus-code notes: POST /migrate answers 303 (Location: /job/<id>); library errors are text/plain; 404 is used deliberately instead of 403 for \"not yours\".",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "PLST_back_domain", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "1" }
  ],
